    "body": "Problem:\r\nA Visual-mode mapping that leaves Visual mode (\"xmap I Q0i\") does not replay its motions/edits at the extra cursors, though an insert session it starts does.\r\n\r\natom_map_start() skips while Visual is active, so the mapping has no `composite`, and atom_capturable() then rejects its commands.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nOpen the `composite` for Visual-mode mappings too.\r\n\r\nBonus: the mapping atom is now reported as:\r\n\r\n    before: type=visual,  keys=\"viwcFOO<Esc>\"\r\n    after:  type=mapping, keys=\"viwc<Esc>iFOO<Esc>\", lhs=\",c\"\r\n\r\nfix https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41694",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-06T18:50:49Z",
